# Tailwind Conventions

## Version
Tailwind CSS **v3** (not v4). Run via PostCSS. Config at `tailwind.config.js`.

## Class Ordering (follow this sequence)
```
1. Layout:     flex, grid, hidden, block, relative, fixed
2. Box model:  w-, h-, p-, m-, gap-, space-
3. Typography: text-, font-, leading-, tracking-, uppercase
4. Colors:     bg-, text-, border-
5. Effects:    rounded-, shadow-, opacity-, transition-, hover:, focus:
6. Responsive: sm:, md:, lg: (always last)
```

## ✅ Allowed
```jsx
// Named design tokens (preferred)
className="bg-secondary text-on-secondary"
className="border border-outline-variant rounded-xl"
className="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
className="p-md gap-md space-y-lg"

// Opacity modifier on tokens
className="bg-secondary/10 bg-error/20"

// State variants
className="hover:bg-surface-container-low focus:border-secondary transition-colors"

// Responsive variants for layout only
className="grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"
className="hidden md:flex"
```

## ❌ Banned
```jsx
// Arbitrary color values when a token exists
className="text-[#0058be]"     // use text-secondary
className="bg-[#ba1a1a]"       // use bg-error
className="p-[24px]"           // use p-md

// Inline styles for anything token-covered
style={{ color: '#0058be' }}   // use className="text-secondary"
style={{ padding: '24px' }}    // use className="p-md"

// Inline styles for font-variation-settings ARE allowed (no Tailwind equivalent)
style={{ fontVariationSettings: "'FILL' 1" }}  // ✅ OK for Material Symbols
style={{ fontSize: 16 }}                        // ✅ OK for icon size overrides
```

## Common Patterns
```jsx
// Card
"bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl p-md"

// Button — primary
"bg-secondary hover:bg-on-secondary-fixed-variant text-on-secondary py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-body-sm font-bold transition-colors"

// Button — secondary/ghost
"border border-outline-variant hover:bg-surface-container text-on-surface py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-body-sm font-semibold transition-colors"

// Input
"border border-outline-variant rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-body-sm bg-surface-container-low focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary transition-colors"

// Toggle switch (on)
"bg-secondary"   // track
"translate-x-6" // thumb

// Toggle switch (off)
"bg-outline-variant"  // track
"translate-x-1"       // thumb
```

## Responsive Breakpoints
```
sm: 640px   (2-col grids)
md: 768px   (show sidebar, hide mobile toggle)
lg: 1024px  (3-col grids, detail panels)
```
The sidebar is `hidden md:flex` — always use `md:ml-64` on the main content spacer.

## Dark Mode
Dark mode is configured (`darkMode: 'class'`) but **not currently used**. Do not add `dark:` classes unless explicitly implementing a theme toggle.
